# Alternative C of PLAN.md §E.1: the throwaway PKI that makes the compatibility
# container speak TCPS and demand a client certificate. Two CAs, a server key, a
# client key, three wallets and a PKCS#12, regenerated from scratch by
# scripts/tls/make-pki.sh on every run of scripts/mac/tls-test.sh.
#
# This line is a default, not the control. packages/base is mirrored to a PUBLIC
# repository, so the control is scripts/ci/crypto-material-guard.sh, which fails
# the release if anything matching key material is TRACKED — including something
# added with `git add -f`, which walks straight past this file.
e2e/tls/
